{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"宇宙"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"宇宙"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subejct":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"类型论","text":"类型论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"类型论","text":"类型论"}},{"Plain":"中, 每个类型都是某个类型 $\\mathcal U$ 的元素, 称这种类型 $\\mathcal U$ 为<strong>宇宙</strong>.</p>\n<p>一个宇宙<strong>不是</strong>自身的元素, 而是更上一层的宇宙的元素.</p>\n"}]}}